<title>PHILIPPINES: ICTSI says 1996 net at 474.7 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>ICTSI says 1996 net at 474.7 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)	  2.5   vs  2.2</p>
<p>    Net income		    474.7 vs  286.7</p>
<p>Note: Full name International Container Terminal Services Inc. The company said the 1995 net income figure excludes gains of 33.9 million pesos from the sale of EEI Corp shares -- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
